  "method": [
    "Local anvil node with cancun rules (no EIP-7623 calldata floor), proxy for Arbitrum execution gas; gasUsed read from real receipts.",
    "Excludes the L1 data fee charged by L2s on top of execution gas.",
    "B0 and B1 send one transaction per post; 10 sampled posts give the per-post cost for every N.",
    "Roots, manifest IDs and post hashes are deterministic pseudo-random 32-byte values (sha256 of a counter), so reruns reproduce the same numbers; gas does not depend on whether a root is a real Merkle root.",
    "B0 username \"ana_example\"; captions of 100 and 1000 ASCII bytes."
  ],
